/**
 * A command talks to the server and keeps the connection, the pipeline and the last error in the object;
 * some write their by-reference arguments (scan iterators). With a serializer option set (Redis::OPT_SERIALIZER),
 * reads also unserialize the values, which this does not account for.
 *
 * @psalm-capabilities read-props|write-this-props|write-refs|io
 */
